# Form Service Configuration

# Choose your form submission service:
# Options: 'emailjs', 'formspree', 'resend', 'custom', 'simulation'
VITE_FORM_SERVICE=simulation

# ============================================================================
# EmailJS Configuration (Client-side, No backend required)
# ============================================================================
# Free tier: 200 emails/month
# Setup: https://www.emailjs.com/
# 
# 1. Create account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Create email service (Gmail, Outlook, etc.)
# 3. Create email template
# 4. Get your credentials from dashboard
# 5. Install dependency: npm install @emailjs/browser
# 6. Set VITE_FORM_SERVICE=emailjs and fill values below:

# VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id
# VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id
# VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key

# ============================================================================
# Formspree Configuration (Client-side, No backend required)
# ============================================================================
# Free tier: 50 submissions/month
# Setup: https://formspree.io/
#
# 1. Create account at https://formspree.io/
# 2. Create a new form
# 3. Copy your Form ID (looks like: xyzabcde)
# 4. Set VITE_FORM_SERVICE=formspree and fill value below:

# VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=your_form_id

# ============================================================================
# Resend Configuration (Backend required - Serverless function)
# ============================================================================
# Modern email API with great developer experience
# Setup: https://resend.com/
#
# 1. Create account at https://resend.com/
# 2. Get API key
# 3. Deploy serverless function (see api/send-email.ts example)
# 4. Set your serverless function endpoint:
# 5. Set VITE_FORM_SERVICE=resend

# VITE_RESEND_ENDPOINT=https://your-app.vercel.app/api/send-email

# ============================================================================
# Custom API Configuration (Your own backend)
# ============================================================================
# If you have your own backend API for handling form submissions
# Set VITE_FORM_SERVICE=custom

# VITE_CUSTOM_API_ENDPOINT=https://your-api.com/submit-form

# ============================================================================
# Development Mode
# ============================================================================
# Use 'simulation' for local development without actual email sending
# This is the default mode - forms will log to console and simulate success

# ============================================================================
# Cloudinary Configuration (Image Hosting & Optimization)
# ============================================================================
# Cloudinary provides image hosting, optimization, and transformations
# Setup: https://cloudinary.com/
#
# 1. Create account at https://cloudinary.com/
# 2. Get your cloud name from dashboard
# 3. Create upload folder (e.g., 'everleaf-medical')
# 4. Fill values below:

# VITE_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your_cloud_name
# VITE_CLOUDINARY_FOLDER=everleaf-medical

# ============================================================================
# Site Configuration (Production Domain)
# ============================================================================
# Set this to your production domain for canonical URLs and OG tags
# Example: https://www.everleafmedical.com or https://everleaf-medical.vercel.app

# VITE_SITE_URL=https://everleaf-medical.com
